    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmospheric</h2>Imagine yourself inside a B-17 flying over enemy-held Europe on your way to Germany.  Deadly Me-109s and FW-190s are hunting you, bullets ripping through the wings and the fuselage of your Flying Fortress. Smoke fills the cabin. You glance out the window to see flames licking the wing.<br><br><br>\u201cEngine 4 is on fire! And I have no rudder control! Let\u2019s put this fire out! Someone head out to the back and see what\u2019s wrong!\u201d<br><br>\u201cI\u2019m on it!\u201d, you shout, running towards the rear gunner station while you scan the cables. \u201cDamn\u201d, you think \u201ca hole in the fuselage and the cables were cut. That FW-190 did some real damage here\u201d. The good news is: you can fix it. Roll up your sleeves and get to it. Quickly!<br><br>We are honored to announce to you, our fans, that MicroProse is working on a brand new The Mighty Eighth title for Virtual Reality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/01a137678d128b68a987410afd399f4b.poster.avif?t=1748915076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/01a137678d128b68a987410afd399f4b.webm?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/01a137678d128b68a987410afd399f4b.mp4?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Co-Op Experience</h2>The Mighty Eighth VR, you will be able to play with 9 other friends (or AI crew) as you work together to survive the war and accomplish your missions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Your Part</h2>Drop those bombs on the right spot, guide your crew through day, or dark, moonless nights, keep your airplane in touch with the rest of the squadron and HQ as you monitor the radio and communications. Defend your B-17 Flying Fortress by keeping those enemy fighters away from you and your squadron mates. Pilot or co-pilot the Flying Fortress under mounting stresses \u2013 from flak and enemy fire, but don\u2019t drop out of formation or you\u2019re a sitting duck. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/4e943ac66472de90778b1b45094196f0.poster.avif?t=1748915076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/4e943ac66472de90778b1b45094196f0.webm?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/4e943ac66472de90778b1b45094196f0.mp4?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A New Survival Experience</h2>The new Mighty Eighth VR is not just a game. It\u2019s an experience from a different time where young men grew old faster than they should and saw things no one should see.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/38f7f74d710c7a18a60b49ad9a106b71.poster.avif?t=1748915076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/38f7f74d710c7a18a60b49ad9a106b71.webm?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/38f7f74d710c7a18a60b49ad9a106b71.mp4?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmospheric</h2>Imagine yourself inside a B-17 flying over enemy-held Europe on your way to Germany.  Deadly Me-109s and FW-190s are hunting you, bullets ripping through the wings and the fuselage of your Flying Fortress. Smoke fills the cabin. You glance out the window to see flames licking the wing.<br><br><br>\u201cEngine 4 is on fire! And I have no rudder control! Let\u2019s put this fire out! Someone head out to the back and see what\u2019s wrong!\u201d<br><br>\u201cI\u2019m on it!\u201d, you shout, running towards the rear gunner station while you scan the cables. \u201cDamn\u201d, you think \u201ca hole in the fuselage and the cables were cut. That FW-190 did some real damage here\u201d. The good news is: you can fix it. Roll up your sleeves and get to it. Quickly!<br><br>We are honored to announce to you, our fans, that MicroProse is working on a brand new The Mighty Eighth title for Virtual Reality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/01a137678d128b68a987410afd399f4b.poster.avif?t=1748915076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/01a137678d128b68a987410afd399f4b.webm?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/01a137678d128b68a987410afd399f4b.mp4?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Co-Op Experience</h2>The Mighty Eighth VR, you will be able to play with 9 other friends (or AI crew) as you work together to survive the war and accomplish your missions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Your Part</h2>Drop those bombs on the right spot, guide your crew through day, or dark, moonless nights, keep your airplane in touch with the rest of the squadron and HQ as you monitor the radio and communications. Defend your B-17 Flying Fortress by keeping those enemy fighters away from you and your squadron mates. Pilot or co-pilot the Flying Fortress under mounting stresses \u2013 from flak and enemy fire, but don\u2019t drop out of formation or you\u2019re a sitting duck. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/4e943ac66472de90778b1b45094196f0.poster.avif?t=1748915076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/4e943ac66472de90778b1b45094196f0.webm?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/4e943ac66472de90778b1b45094196f0.mp4?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A New Survival Experience</h2>The new Mighty Eighth VR is not just a game. It\u2019s an experience from a different time where young men grew old faster than they should and saw things no one should see.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/38f7f74d710c7a18a60b49ad9a106b71.poster.avif?t=1748915076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/38f7f74d710c7a18a60b49ad9a106b71.webm?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1325580/extras/38f7f74d710c7a18a60b49ad9a106b71.mp4?t=1748915076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "The Mighty 8th VR puts you in the shoes of a B-17 Flying Fortress crew member at the height of the Strategic Bombing Campaign over Europe. Partner up with friends and do your part to ensure that the plane reaches the target and returns home safely.",
